{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore dynamic battlegrounds, perfect your tactics, and face ever-evolving foes in your quest for domination. Will your army reign supreme, or will the monsters crush your dreams? The choice is yours\u2014plan, build, and fight for victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build Your Army:</strong> Recruit warriors with unique skills and combine their strengths to create the ultimate battle team.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Craft and Upgrade Gear:</strong> Enhance your troops with crafted weapons, shields, and banners that inspire resilience and fury on the battlefield.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic Monster Encounters:</strong> Test your strategy against a variety of challenging monsters, each with their own quirks and strengths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Strategic Depth:</strong> Balance resources, manage upgrades, and adapt to changing battle scenarios for maximum success.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prepare for epic battles and endless strategy in CRIMSON HORN\u2014where your wits and weapons decide the fate of the battlefield!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3807560?t=1753030419","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3807560?t=1753030419","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807560/332f74d24396c51659c14e0f0e9feb19ff568dea/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753030419","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807560/332f74d24396c51659c14e0f0e9feb19ff568dea/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753030419","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">E